<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  Real Glass & Water: every text a player reads, in English. The source for every translation.

  To translate: copy this file, name it with the game's code for your language (de.xml, es.xml,
  fr.xml, ko.xml, pl.xml, pt.xml, ru.xml, zh.xml), set code and name below, and translate the
  text between the tags. Leave the keys alone.

  American English.

  - {0}, {1}... are filled in by the mod (a number, a name). Keep every one of them.
  - A long text can be wrapped over several lines here: the break reads as one space.
  - \n is a real line break (used in the dialogs).
  - A key missing from a translation shows in English, so a partial translation works.

  A label says what its row does. A tooltip (Name.Tooltip) only where the label leaves a question:
  what 100% is, what off gives back, what a switch really changes. One short line, at most 70
  characters, never the label again. Everyday words, no rendering terms (shader, screen-space,
  raymarch, cubemap, Fresnel).
-->
<Language code="en" name="English">

